            <ArticleTitle>Bone metastases from a cerebral and sacral ependymoma. Report of a case.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>471-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of cerebral and sacral ependymoma revealed by cerebellar syndrome and sciatica in a 68-year-old man is reported. Bone metastases were diagnosed seven months after surgical excision of the brain tumor.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
